<title>ZAIRE: European Union envoys in Zaire for talks.</title>
<headline>European Union envoys in Zaire for talks.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A European Union delegation arrived in Zaire's capital Kinshasa on Sunday for talks on the plight of over a million Hutu refugees and Zaireans fleeing fighting in the east, diplomats said.</p>
<p>The team was led by EU commissioner for humanitarian aid Emma Bonino.</p>
